            text: "No. Models advertised as iFIT compatible, such as the 430i, work in manual mode and on their built-in programmes without a membership. iFIT adds trainer-led workouts and automatic speed and incline control. Reviews say the Trainer 720 has no Bluetooth, so it does not connect to iFIT. Support for older hardware is not guaranteed, so ask iFIT about your model number.",
