          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Gold’s Gym treadmills were ICON machines — the same company that
          makes NordicTrack and ProForm — sold under licence from 2001 until the exclusive deal ended
          in 2019.</strong> The Trainer 430i and Trainer 720 are out of production, and we could not
          find a current Gold’s Gym home treadmill from an identifiable licensed maker.
          </p>
